---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { aiSummaries, external } from "../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Usage Disclosure" description="Course-level AI usage disclosure for MobyDick CO3133 projects." current="ai">
  <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p><h1>AI Usage Disclosure</h1><p class="page-lead">A concise public record of AI-assisted work. Detailed, assignment-specific entries remain versioned in the repository.</p></section>
  <section class="shell article-layout"><article><section class="article-section"><h2>Disclosure standard</h2><p>For every tool used, the group records the tool and version when known, member, development stage, purpose, affected sections, prompt or log reference, verification, responsible reviewer, and sources. AI assistance does not replace student responsibility for code, results, or claims.</p></section><section class="article-section"><h2>Public summaries</h2><div class="ai-grid">{aiSummaries.map((entry) => <article class="ai-card"><p class="eyebrow">{entry.assignment}</p><h3>{entry.tool}</h3><p>{entry.summary}</p><small>{entry.verification}</small><p><a class="text-link" href={entry.href}>Open detailed repository record →</a></p></article>)}</div></section><section class="article-section"><h2>Assignment-specific records</h2><p>Assignment 1 and Assignment 2 maintain detailed logs alongside the corresponding source. Assignment 3 has not started and therefore has no assignment-specific AI-use record yet.</p></section></article><aside class="side-stack"><section class="resource-card"><p class="eyebrow">Resources</p><h2>Detailed logs</h2><a class="resource-link" href={external.rootAi}><span>Course-level log</span><b>Open ↗</b></a><a class="resource-link" href={external.a1Ai}><span>Assignment 1 log</span><b>Open ↗</b></a><a class="resource-link" href={external.a2Ai}><span>Assignment 2 log</span><b>Open ↗</b></a></section></aside></section>
</BaseLayout>
